# samples 只允许提交说明文件和唯一的原始行情测试样例。
# 原始行情常用“周期#合约.txt”命名，无论放在何处都默认忽略。
*#*.txt
*#*.TXT
/samples/**/*.txt
/samples/**/*.csv
/samples/**/*.dat
/samples/**/*.data
/samples/**/*.parquet
/samples/**/*.arrow
/samples/**/*.feather
/samples/**/*.zip
/samples/**/*.7z
!/samples/30#AO2609.txt

